WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.602 --> 00:00:04.882
1. In Manage hosting, open File manager.

2
00:00:04.882 --> 00:00:09.366
2. Pick the website. Its public_html folder opens.

3
00:00:09.366 --> 00:00:15.740
3. Click Upload and choose the file (up to 4 MB; use FTP for bigger files).

4
00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:22.904
4. The file appears in the list when the upload finishes.
